    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sip Fisher is an incremental fishing game about draining a lake of all its water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start out on an old dock surrounded by a vast and daunting lake. <strong>Sip</strong> up water from the lake, sell the <strong>fish</strong> you find, and upgrade your equipment to <strong>sip</strong> up the lake faster. Relax and explore as the lake gets lower. Progress until you have a massive dock and find out what\u2019s at the bottom!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sip Fisher is an incremental fishing game about draining a lake of all its water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start out on an old dock surrounded by a vast and daunting lake. <strong>Sip</strong> up water from the lake, sell the <strong>fish</strong> you find, and upgrade your equipment to <strong>sip</strong> up the lake faster. Relax and explore as the lake gets lower. Progress until you have a massive dock and find out what\u2019s at the bottom!</p>",
    "short_description": "Have you ever wanted to drink an entire lake through a straw? Well now you can in this cozy incremental fishing game! There's so much to sip in the lake, so upgrade your straw, drink up schools of fish, and maybe find what's at the bottom of the Lake!",
